# Special meter full (set for the test): Left, Right then L in the air is a Christ Air, held a moment.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
cmd 0 set skater.special 1
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap left 92
tap right 96
hold grab 98..140
run 320
expect event trickStart{trick=Christ Air} within 97..101
expect no event bail
